<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Guthrie 6-mth net down 73.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Guthrie 6-mth net down 73.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  13.55   vs	  50.84</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  1.36   vs	   5.08</p>
<p>    Turnover		   625.50   vs	 788.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    67.88   vs	 120.23</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less 24.21   vs  less  28.54</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 5.0    vs	   5.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Kumpulan Guthrie Bhd is a plantations and property concern.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
